1
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:11,562
[Chorus: full male choir with lead, daf]

2
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:15,782
We rise as one from every shore,

3
00:00:15,782 --> 00:00:19,556
together, stronger than before;

4
00:00:19,556 --> 00:00:23,573
we pack our zaad, we take the road,

5
00:00:23,573 --> 00:00:27,608
and carry light, and share the load.

6
00:00:27,608 --> 00:00:27,608
[Verse 1: lead voice, light daf, choir hum]

7
00:00:27,608 --> 00:00:31,517
At dawn, a child begins to read,

8
00:00:31,517 --> 00:00:35,498
and every word becomes a seed;

9
00:00:35,498 --> 00:00:39,529
we plant it here, and it will grow

10
00:00:39,529 --> 00:00:42,952
in Jannah, more than we know.

11
00:00:42,952 --> 00:00:42,952
[Verse 2: lead voice, choir harmonies join]

12
00:00:42,952 --> 00:00:46,950
The Quran's tongue runs in our veins,

13
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:50,918
a pulse, a flame that still remains;

14
00:00:50,918 --> 00:00:54,813
we lift it high with pride and grace

15
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:58,869
and let it shine in every place.

16
00:00:58,869 --> 00:00:58,869
[Resolve: call and response, lead sings, choir answers in unison]

17
00:00:58,869 --> 00:01:02,852
Our will is stone, it will not break,

18
00:01:02,852 --> 00:01:02,852
[Resolve: call and response, lead sings, choir answers in unison]

19
00:01:02,852 --> 00:01:06,833
Our will is stone, it will not break,

20
00:01:06,833 --> 00:01:06,833
(our will is stone, it will not break)

21
00:01:06,833 --> 00:01:10,769
we will not bend, we will not shake;

22
00:01:10,769 --> 00:01:10,769
(our will is stone, it will not break)

23
00:01:10,769 --> 00:01:14,549
we will not bend, we will not shake;

24
00:01:14,549 --> 00:01:14,549
(we will not bend, we will not shake)

25
00:01:14,549 --> 00:01:18,648
and if a mountain blocks the way,

26
00:01:18,648 --> 00:01:26,176
with faith we climb it, come what may.

27
00:01:26,176 --> 00:01:26,176
[Verse 3: lead voice, soft daf, choir hum]

28
00:01:26,176 --> 00:01:30,021
A friend to walk the path with you,

29
00:01:30,021 --> 00:01:33,983
who sees the best in all you do;

30
00:01:33,983 --> 00:01:37,929
and when you fall, he's at your side,

31
00:01:37,929 --> 00:01:43,896
he lifts you up, he is your guide.

32
00:01:43,896 --> 00:01:43,896
[Chorus: full male choir with lead, daf]

33
00:01:43,896 --> 00:01:47,941
We rise as one from every shore,

34
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:51,745
together, stronger than before;

35
00:01:51,745 --> 00:01:55,736
we pack our zaad, we take the road,

36
00:01:55,736 --> 00:01:59,178
and carry light, and share the load.

37
00:01:59,178 --> 00:01:59,178
[Final Resolve: everyone in unison, strongest, layered harmonies]

38
00:01:59,178 --> 00:02:03,161
Our will is stone, it will not break,

39
00:02:03,161 --> 00:02:06,870
we will not bend, we will not shake;

40
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:11,023
and if a mountain blocks the way,

41
00:02:11,023 --> 00:02:14,140
with faith we climb it, come what may.

42
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:21,453
[End: choir holds the last word]

